],"lines_en":["Quarrying and stone sales: Extracts and sells earth stones and other stone products.","Biomass by-product sales: Sells biomass by-products.","Biomass and biogas power generation: Invests in and operates a 12-megawatt biomass power plant and a 4-megawatt biogas power plant in Sandakan, Sabah.","Other businesses: Includes oil palm fresh fruit bunch collection center leasing, investment property holding, and power generation."]}}